<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">NEKEMIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Nekemia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nekemia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nek</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">NEKEMIA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Nekemia </char> kitwero poko iye i dul angwen mapatpat kit man: (1) Dwogo pa Nekemia cen i Jerucalem ikare ma onongo Aritakcec ma obedo laloc madit me lobo Percia aye ooro en me bedo laloc me Juda; (2) Gero cel me Jerucalem odoco; (3) Woro madit ma Ejira okwano kwede ki Cik pa Lubanga, ki kit ma dano gungut kwede ikom balgi ka gin guwinyo lok me Cik ducu; (4) Jami mogo mukene ma Nekemia otiyo ikare ma en aye onongo tye kaloyo lobo Juda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Gin ma pire tek tutwal i buk man en aye gen pa Nekemia ikom Lubanga, ki legane bot Lubanga kare ki kare i yone ducu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Dwogo pa Nekemia i Jerucalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 1:1-2:20">1:1—2:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cel me Jerucalem kigero odoco <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 3:1-7:73">3:1—7:73</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kikwano Cik pa Rwot Lubanga ci kiroco gicike <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 8:1-10:39">8:1—10:39</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tic pa Nekemia mukene ma en otiyo <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 11:1-13:31">11:1—13:31</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nekemia olego pi Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Man lok pa Nekemia wod pa Kakalia:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">I dwe me Kiclev, i mwaka me pyere aryo me loc pa rwot Aritakcec, an Nekemia onongo atye i taun madit me Cuca, <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />ci Kanani, ma ngat acel ma ikom utmegina, obino bota kacel ki jo mogo ma gua ki i Juda. Ci an apenyogi lok ikom Jerucalem ki ikom jo ma gubwot, mayam kiterogi i opii ci gudok cen kunu. <verse eid="NEH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Gin guwaca ni, “Jo ma gitye i lobowa kunu ma gubwot mayam kiterogi i opii gitye ki peko madit mada ma jo mukene cayogi bene; ki dogcel me Jerucalem kimuku woko opoto piny, dok dog taun ne bene ducu kiwangogi woko ki mac.”<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Ka awinyo lok meno ducu, ci abedo piny akok matek. Abedo kakumu pi nino mapol; kun arii kec ma pe acamo cam ento abedo kalego Lubanga me polo. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Alego kun awaco ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga me polo, in idit, dok wabedo ki lworo inyimi. In Lubanga me ada dok igwoko gicikeni ki mar meri ma pe loke pi jo ma gimari dok ma gilubu cik meri. <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />Rwot, nena, dok iwiny legana, ma atye kalegone dyeceng jwi ki dyewor bene pi lutici, lwak me Icrael. Atucu balwa inyimi ni wan jo Icrael watyeko timo bal inyimi. Eyo, an ki jo me dogola pa kwara watimo bal. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Wan watimo gin marac mada inyimi, pe wabedo katiyo gin ma iciko, pe bene walubu cik meri mayam imiyo botwa kun wok ki bot latici Moses. <verse eid="NEH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref></char></note>Po ikom lok mayam iciko ki latici Moses, kun iwaco ni, ‘Ka pe wulubu cika; ci abikeyowu woko ata ikin lurok; <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:1-5">Nwo 30:1-5</ref></char></note>ento ka wuloke wudwogo bota kun wulubu cika, kadi bed kikeyowu kiketowu woko ata nio wa i agiki piny, an abicokowu adwokowu cen wa i kabedo ma dong atyeko yerone pi nyinga wek wuwora iye.’ <verse eid="NEH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />Rwot, jo man gin lutici, dok gin lwaki mayam ilarogi ki tweroni madwong dok ki teki. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Ai Rwot, kombedi dong in iwiny legana ki lega pa jo mukenegu ducu ma gitye ki cwiny me woro in. Mina gum tin ai Rwot, dok imii kica omak rwot Aritakcec ikoma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Ikare meno onongo an abedo ladit maloyo lok ikom kongo bwino ma rwot mato.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nekemia ocito i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />I dwe me Nican, i mwaka me pyere aryo me loc pa rwot Aritakcec, ma onongo rwot tye kacam, akwanyo kongo bwino atero bote. Onongo yam peya abedo ki cwercwiny mo inyime. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Rwot ocako penya ni, “Pingo wangi nen ki can kun in inen calo komi yot do? Man can mo aye mono tye i cwinyi bo?” Cutcut lworo otugi maka woko matek. <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:8-10">2 Luk 25:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:19">2 Tek 36:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:12-14">Jer 52:12-14</ref></char></note>Ci agamo dog rwot ni, “Rwot Aritakcec obed kwo nakanaka! Wanga pe twero nen ki can ningning, ma kun taun madit kama kiyiko iye kwariwa ducu dong odoko obur, ma dog gangine ducu kiwango woko liweng ki mac?” <verse eid="NEH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Rwot dok openya ni, “Dong imito gin ango kono?” Cutcut alego Lubanga me polo. <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />Ka dong agamo dog rwot ni, “Kace ineno ni ber, ladita rwot, ka itwero ye legana, wek acit i lobo me Juda i gangkal kama kwariwa kiyikogi iyeni, wek acit ayub taun madit meno odoco.” <verse eid="NEH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Rwot odoka iye ma onongo dakere obedo kangete ni, “Wot meno biteri kare marom mene, dok ibidwogo awene?” Ci atite bene nino ma abia iye kikome; ci rwot oye pi citona kunu.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Ka dok awaco bot rwot ni, “Kace ineno ni ber, myero kicoo waraga ci imiya ater bot luloc ma i lobo matye Loka Kulu, ma tito botgi ni myero guye akat acit i Juda. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Dok apenyo rwot bene ni omyero oco waraga omiya ater bot Acap, ma lagwok bunga pa rwot, wek omiya yadi wek kitii ki bao pi yubu dogcel me gogo ma gwoko Ot pa Lubanga, ki pi cel ma orumu taun, ki pi ot ma an abibedo iye.” Ci rwot oye ci omiya gin ducu ma alege pire, pien Lubanga onongo tye kakonya.<verse eid="NEH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Ci rwot ocwalo an kacel ki ludito me mony ki dul pa wegi aguragura, ci acito i lobo matye Loka Kulu tung kupotoceng, ci amiyo waraga pa rwot bot luloc me lobo. <verse eid="NEH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Ento Canbalat ma jo Bet-koron, ki Tobia ma en jo Ammon, ka guwinyo lok man, ci gubedo ki keco i cwinygi matek pien gungeyo ni dano mo obino pi konyo kor jo Icrael.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Ci acito i Jerucalem arii kunu pi nino adek <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />ma pe atito bot ngat mo tam ma Lubanga otyeko keto i cwinya, ma myero atii kwede pi Jerucalem. Cutcut i cwiny dyewor aa malo ci wacako wot kacel ki lurema mogo. Pe onongo watye ki lee mo mukene kono kana ma abedo iwiyeni keken. <verse eid="NEH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Akato acito woko i dyewor kun awok i dogcel me cito i nota nio kwede iwang It pa Too ki i dogcel ma cito wi odur, ci acako ngiyo cel me Jerucalem ducu mayam kimuku opoto woko piny, kacel ki dogcel ducu mayam kiwango woko liweng ki mac. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Ka dok aloke acito i Dogcel me Wang it ki i Kut pa rwot. Kana ma abedo iwiyeni onongo pe twero nongo yoo mo ma myero ekat ki iye, <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />omiyo aa acito kangiyo cel kun awok ki i nota; ka adok cen i taun madit ki i dogcel ma cito i nota, kun adok cen awok ki i yoo ma acito kwede. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Pe tye ngat mo ikin ludito ma giloyo lwak ma ongeyo kama acito iye ki gin ma abedo katiyone. Onongo peya atito gin mo bot Lujudaya, ajwaki, ludito ma giloyo lwak ducu, kadi ki bot jo mukene ma onongo omyero gutii tic meno.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Ka dong awaco botgi ni, “Wunen kit ayela ma watye kwede kombedi, kong wunen Jerucalem dong odoko obur, wa dog cele ducu kiwango woko. Wubin wek wacaku gero cel me Jerucalem odoco, wek lewic pe obed kamakowa.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Ka dok atito botgi kit macalo Lubanga obedo kweda dok okonya maber, kacel ki lok ducu ma ceng rwot owaco bota. Gin gugamo ni, “Wacaku gerone odoco.” Ci guyube me cako tic cut, guketo cwinygi me tiyo tice maber. <verse eid="NEH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Ento ka Canbalat ma jo Bet-koron, ki Tobia ma latic pa jo Ammon, ki Gecem ma Laarab guwinyo pi gin ma watye katiyone, ci gucako nywarowa kun gicayowa bene ma giwaco ni, “Man gin ango ma wutye katiyoneni? Wun wumito jemo ikom rwot?” <verse eid="NEH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Ci adok iye botgi ni, “Lubanga me polo aye bikonyowa, wan lutice, dong wabicako gedo. Ento pe tye dul mo ma kipoko ki wun i Jerucalem, wa nyingwu bene peke i tekwarone.”<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Gero cel me Jerucalem odoco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Eliacib ma ajwaka madit, ki ajwaki ma gin utmegine, gugero Dogcel me Romo. Gukwero wek obed maleng dok guketo kikane. Gugero nio wa i lubele me Miya ki Lubele ma kilwongo ni Kananel.<verse eid="NEH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Jo Jeriko gugero dul mukene macok kwede ki Jakur wod pa Imri ogero bene dul ma lubu meno.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Likwayo pa Acena gugero dogcel me Rec; guriyo baone ka guketo kikane, bolti, ki rii me dogola me lorone.<verse eid="NEH 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Dano ma olubugi obedo Meremot wod pa Uria, ma wod pa Kakoj, ma oyubu dul ma ingete.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:4">Dano ma oyubu dul ma ingete obedo Meculam wod pa Berekia ma wod pa Mecejabel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:4">Dano mukene ma oyubu dul ma ingete obedo Jadok wod pa Baana.<verse eid="NEH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Jo ma guyubu dul mukene ma ingete malubu gin aye jo Tekoa, ento luditogi me awora pe guye tiyo tic mapek ma jo ma loyogi gumiyogi.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Ka dok Joyada wod pa Pacea, ki Meculam wod pa Becodeya guyubu Dogcel Macon: guriyo baone ka guketo kikane, ki bolti ki rii me dogola me lorone.<verse eid="NEH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Jo ma guyubu dul mukene ma ingete obedo Melatia jo Gibeon, ki Jadon jo Meronot kacel ki jo ma i taun gi me Gibeon ki Mijpa, ma gitye ite loc pa laloc me lobo ma Loka Kulu.<verse eid="NEH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Ujiel wod pa Karaya ma en latet jabu bene oyubu dul mukene ma ingete.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:8">Ngat mukene ma olube obedo Anania ma layub moo ma ngwece kur, en oyubu dul mukene; ci guroco Jerucalem odwogo kakare nio kwede wa ikom Cel Malac.<verse eid="NEH 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Ngat mukene ma olubugi en aye Repaya wod pa Kur, ma en loyo nucu lobo ma orumu Jerucalem, en bene oyubu dul mukene.<verse eid="NEH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Ngat mukene ma olubu obedo Jedaya wod pa Karumap, en oyubu mere dul ma okemo ode; ki ngat ma olube obedo Katuc wod pa Kacabneya, en oyubu dul mukene.<verse eid="NEH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Malkija wod pa Karim ki Kacub wod pa Pakat-moab guyubu dul mukene ki cel Gogo me Lubele me Tedo Mugati ducu.<verse eid="NEH 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Ngat mukene ma olubu obedo Calum wod pa Kalokeci, maloyo nucu lobo ma orumu Jerucalem, en oyubu dul mukene (ki anyirane bene gukonye.)<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Kanun ki jo ma gibedo i Janoa guyubu dogcel ma cito i nota. Guroco cel odok kakare ka guketo kikane, ki bolti ki rii me dogola me lorone, ka guyubu cel gogo ma bore romo mita miya angwen ki pyere angwen, nio kwede wa i dogcel ma cito iwi odur.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Malkija wod pa Recab, ma laloc me lobo ma orumu Beta-kerem, oyubu dogcel ma cito iwi odur; ogero odoco ka oketo kikane, ki bolti ki rii me dogola me lorone ducu.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Calum wod pa Kolkoje, laloc me lobo Mijpa, oyubu Dogcel me Wang It; ogero odoco dok oumu wiye ka oketo kikane, ki bolti ki rii me dogola me lorone ducu; ka dok en ogero cel orumu Kut Cela macok ki poto pa rwot, nio kwede wa i rwom ma lor piny nia ki i taun madit ma i kal pa Daudi.<verse eid="NEH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Ngat ma olubu en obedo Nekemia wod pa Ajbuk, ma laloc me nucu lobo Bet-jur; en oyubu kama okeme ki Lyel pa Daudi, macok ki kut ma kikwinyo akwinya ki cing, tung odi pa twoni oteka lweny.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lulevi ma gubedo katiyo tic ikom cel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Jo ma olubu en obedo Lulevi magi: Rekum wod pa Bani, ki ngat ma olube obedo Kacabia, ma laloc me nucu lobo ma orumu Keila; guyubu pi nying lobone.<verse eid="NEH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Lacen utmegigi bene ma guyubu but cel mukene, gin ene: Bavai wod pa Kenadad, ma laloc me nucu lobo ma orumu Keila.<verse eid="NEH 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Ngat ma olubu en obedo Ejer wod pa Yecwa, ma laloc me Mijpa; en oyubu dule me aryone mukene ma okeme ki ot kano jami lweny me mony ma itwok cel.<verse eid="NEH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Ngat ma olubu en obedo Baruk wod pa Jabai; en oyubu dule mukene nia ki i twoke ma tung dogola me ot pa Eliacib ajwaka madit.<verse eid="NEH 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Ngat ma olubu en obedo Meremot wod pa Uria, ma wod pa Kakoj; oyubu dul ot mukene nia ki idogola me ot pa Eliacib nio wa i agiki ot.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ajwaki ma gutiyo tic ikom cel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Jo ma gulube obedo ajwaki ma gibedo i lobo bar, guyubu dul mukene.<verse eid="NEH 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Jo ma olubugi obedo Benjamin ki Kacub; guyubu dul mukemo odigi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:23">Ngat ma olubugi obedo Ajaria wod pa Maceya, ma wod pa Anania ma oyubu mere ma cok ki ode kikome.<verse eid="NEH 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Ngat ma olubu en obedo Binui wod pa Kenadad; en oyubu dul mukene, nia ki ikom ot pa Ajaria nio kwede i twok cel kama ogoneni.<verse eid="NEH 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />Ka Palal wod pa Ujai oyubu gule ma i iye, kacel ki lubele ma okemo ot pa rwot ma idyekal pa lukurpiny.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:25">Ngat ma olubu en obedo Pedaya wod pa Paroc.<verse eid="NEH 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />Lutic i Ot pa Lubanga ma gibedo ikom Opel, guyubu dule mukene macok ki Dogcel me Pii tung kunyango me lubele me kuru ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="NEH 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Jo ma gulubu en obedo jo Tekoa; guyubu dul mukene mukemo lubele madit ma wiye ocudu malo likung nio kwede wa ikom cel macok ki Opel.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Ajwaki guyubu ka wi Dogcel me Aguragura, kun ngat acel acel yubu ma okemo tung ode kikome.<verse eid="NEH 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Ngat ma olubugi obedo Jadok wod pa Imer ma oyubu mere kama okemo ode kikome.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:29">Ngat ma olubu en obedo Cemaya wod pa Cekania, ma lagwok dogcel ma tung kunyango: en oyubu bene dul mukene.<verse eid="NEH 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Jo ma gulube obedo Anania wod pa Celemia, ki Kanun wod pa Jalap me abicele, guyubu dul mukene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:30">Ngat ma olubu en obedo Meculam wod pa Berekia ma oyubu kama okemo kicikane.<verse eid="NEH 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Ngat ma olubu en obedo Malkija, ngat acel ikom lutet jabu; en oyubu dul mukene nia ki i ot pa lutic i ot pa Lubanga ki pa lucatwil, ma okemo dogcel me coyo nying jo nio kwede wa i kicika mamalo ma itwoke.<verse eid="NEH 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Ikin kicika mamalo ma itwoke ki Dogcel me Romo, jo ma giliyo jabu, ki lucatwil aye guyubu dul mukene meno.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nekemia oloyo jo ma gitye ki mone ikom tice</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Ikare meno, ka Canbalat owinyo ni wan Lujudaya watye kagero cel me Jerucalem odoco, ci kiniga ki akemo madwong omake matek, ka dok ocako cayowa. <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />Ki kiniganeni en ocako nywarowa ki inyim luwote kacel ki inyim mony me Camaria kun waco ni, “Man Lujudaya ma gigoroni gitye katiyo gin ango ka? Gitamo ni gitwero gero taun madit man odoco? Gibityero gitum mo? Gitwero tyeko tic man inino acel keken? Gitwero payo godi me gedo ducu ki ikom godi ma gudure iwi odur yugi ma kiwangoni?” <verse eid="NEH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Tobia ma dano me Ammon onongo tye ocung kangete, ci owaco ni, “Kit cel ango mono ma gin twero gerone? Kadi too mamwani ka owoto ki iwiye, ci muku cel gotgini reto woko piny!”<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Ci alego ni, “Ai Lubangawa, winy ka gicayowa; wek lok cac ma gicayowa kwede ni odok iwigi, imii kiyak jamigi woko ducu dok kimakgi kitergi i opii i lobo pa lurok. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Pe iwek balgi mo, dok wii pe omyero owil ikom balgi kadi ki acel, pien guyetowa wan ma watye kagedoni.”<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Kitmeno wan wamede ki gero cel; ci watyeko gero cel woko oyotoyot oo wa malo i nucu me bore mayam con ca. Man otime pien lwak onongo gitye ki cwiny me tic kikome.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Ento ikare ma Canbalat ki Tobia ki jo Arab, jo Ammon ki jo Acidod guwinyo ni watye kawot anyim ki tic me yubu cel me Jerucalem ki dok ni wacako culu kama twolone woko ducu, ci kiniga omakogi matek. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Ci gucoke kacel kapiro lok me cito ka lweny ikomwa i Jerucalem, ki kelo anyobanyoba bot dano ma gitye kunu. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Ento wan wamede ki lego Lubangawa, dok waketo co me kuru piny me gwokowa dyeceng ki dyewor ki ikomgi.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Ento jo Juda gubedo kawero wer ma waco ni. “Kero kom luywek godi dong otum woko; dok yugi bene dong odure iye lipim; watwero gero cel man dong tin ningning?”<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Lukworwa gutamo ni wan pe wabitwero nenogi dok pe wabitwero ngeyo gin matye katime, nio ka gibio wa botwa kany, ci ginekowa dok gigiko ticwa woko cut. <verse eid="NEH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Lujudaya ma gibedo ikin lumerokwa gubedo kabino botwa kare ki kare kun gitito botwa tyen ma romo apar kulu yub ma lumerokwa gitye kwede ikomwa; kun gibino ma gia ki i kabedo ducu kama gibedo iye. <verse eid="NEH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Oyotoyot acako poko jami lweny magi bot lwak, pala lucwan, tongi ki atum, ci aketogi gubedo i kabedo mo ma inge cel kun lubu dogolagi, kama pud odong twolo. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Ka aneno gin matye katime, ci aa malo awaco bot ludito ma gin lutel wic, ki ludito ma giloyo lwak, ki bot lwak ducu ni, “Pe wubed ki lworo mo ikom lukworwa. Wupo ni Rwot dit dok kilworo; pi eno wun myero wulweny matek pi jo me lobowu, pi lutinowu, pi monwu, ki pi paciwu.”<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Ka lumerokwa guwinyo ni lok me yubgi otyeko winye botwa ci guniang ni Lubanga oturu yubgi woko, ci wan ducu wacako dok cen katic ikom cel, dano acel acel odok i dog tice.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Cake ikare meno nucu pa lwaka gubedo kagedo, ki nucugi mukene gumako tonggi, kwotgi, ki atumgu, kun gin guruku koti me nyonyo lageng korgi me lweny, kun ludongo pa lwak ducu gucwako jo me ot pa Juda, <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />ma onongo gitye kagero cel odoco. Jo ma gin luting yec bene gubedo katic kit man, dano acel acel tingo jami mamite pi gedo ki cinge acel, ki jami lwenye nongo omako icinge tung cel. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Ka dok dano acel acel ikin jo ma gin lugedo bedo ki pala lucwane ma otweyo woko i pyere kun nongo tye kwede ka gedo. Dano ma en lakut tum onongo bedo mere cok gire kangeta. <verse eid="NEH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Atito ki rwodi kacel ki ludito ma giloyo lwak i dog tic ni, “Tic dong onya odoko dwong tutwal omiyo kinwa odoko lac ki kinwa bene opoke woko ki ikom cel, ki kin dano bene odoko bor ki lawote. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Ci i kabedo ma wuwinyo tum okok iye, myero wucoke botwa kunu. Lubangawa bilweny pirwa.”<verse eid="NEH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Kitmeno, wabedo katic ikom cel nino ducu cake okokgweno nio idyewor ka lakalatwe otuc, ma nongo nucu pa lwakwa mukene gucung ki tonggi icinggi gikuru piny. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />An dok awaco ki lwak ikare meno ni, “Wek dano acel acel ki latice gudony gubut i Jerucalem, ci gubed kakuru piny pirwa idyewor ka dok gutii tic idyeceng.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Pe tye dano mo ikinwa, kadi wa an kikoma nyo utmegina nyo lukur piny ma gulubu kora ma olunyu bongine. Dano acel acel obedo ki jami lwenye i cinge.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Diyo lucan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Lacen jo mapol, co kacel ki mon gi, gucako ngur ikom Lujudaya wadigi. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Jo mogo guwaco ni, “Wan kacel ki lutino awobewa ki anyirawa dong wadoko dwong; wamito kal me acama wek wabed kwo.” <verse eid="NEH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Jo mukene bene guwaco ni, “Wan wajengo potiwa, poti olokwa, kacel ki odiwa ducu, wek wanong kal wacam, pien kec tye marac.” <verse eid="NEH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Dok jo mukene bene guwaco ni, “Wan dong watyeko deno lim me culu mucoro pa rwot kun wajengo potiwa ki poti olokwa pire. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Wan mono pe wamito jami marom aroma ki jami ma Lujudaya wadiwa gimito? Lutinowa kono pe giber marom ki lutinogi? Ento watye kamiyo lutinowa gibedo opii. Dong watyeko cato anyirawa mukene bene woko me bedo opii. Wan pe watye ki twero mo, pien dong kityeko kwanyo potiwa ki poti olokwa woko ducu ki botwa.”<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Ikare ma an Nekemia awinyo koko meggi kacel ki lok pa lwak kiniga omaka matek, <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Nia 22:25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:35-37">Lev 25:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:19-20">Nwo 23:19-20</ref></char></note>abedo kalwodo loke ki icwinya kekena, cutcut acako laro lok ki lutela kacel ki ludito ma giloyo lobo, kun awaco ki gin ni, “Wun wutye kadiyo omegiwu.” Alwongo kacoke madit man me neno lok ikomgi, <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />kun awaco botgi ni, “Wabedo kakoko omegiwa ma gin Lujudaya ki lim kit macalo watwero, mayam kicatogi woko bot lurok. Ento wun kombedi wutye kacato omegiwu kikome ni wan Lujudaya wadgi aye dok wa wilgi!” Ludito guling alinga litik, ma pe gitwero nongo lok mo ma myero guwaci. <verse eid="NEH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Ka dok awaco ki gin ni, “Gin ma wutye katiyoneni pe ber. Pe wutamoni wun omyero wulwor Lubangawa i timwu ducu? Ka pe wulworo Lubangawa, ci miyo lumerokwa gicayowa. <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Ento an kacel ki utmegina ki lutica ducu wamiyo kideno lim ki kal ki botwa. Wan dong waweku tam ducu me limo magobani obedi. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Tin wudwok potigi odok i cinggi, poti olokgi, poti jeitunigi kacel ki odigi ducu. Dok wungol banya ma gitye kwede botwu macalo me lim ryalgi, kal, kongo bwino, nyo moogu ma wubedo kajogone ki botgini.” <verse eid="NEH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Ci ludito gugamo ni. “Wan wabitiyo kit ma iwaconi, wabidwoko jami magi ducu botgi, dok pe wabipenyogi ni gucul banyawa.” Alwongo ajwaki, ci amiyo ludito gukwongo kwong ma moko ni gibigwoko cikegi. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Acako yengo kitambara ki i pyera kun adongo taca ma awaco ni, “Man aye kit ma Lubanga biyengo kwede dano mo ma ikinwu ma pe bicobo kwong man kun gwoko cike. Ci Lubanga biyengo odiwu ki jami ducu ma wutye kwede, biweko wudong nono labongo gin mo.” Jo ducu ma onongo gitye i kacoke gugamo ni, “Amen” dok gupako Rwot. Ci lwak gutiyo kit macalo gucike kwede.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Pi mwaka apar wiye aryo ma onongo an laloc me lobo Juda, cake i mwaka me pyere aryo nio kwede i mwaka pyere adek wiye aryo me loc pa rwot Aritakcec, pe tye utmegina mo kadi ki an ma ocamo kit cam ma kiyubu ni kimii bota macalo laloc me lobo. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Luloc mayam gubedo i loc ma gutelo nyima guketo peko madwong ikom lwak pi jogo lim me ryal pyere angwen, ki kongo bwino, ki cam. Luticgi guloko lwak gudoko opiigi, guketo peko madwong bene ikom lwak. Ento an pe atimo kumeno, pien an abedo kalworo dog Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />An aketo kerona ducu kagero cel meno odoco, pe alimo dul lobo mo me bedo mera. Dok lutica ducu gucoke kunu gubedo mere katiyo tic me gedo. <verse eid="NEH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Dok onongo atye ki jo maromo miya acel ki pyere abic, ma gin Lujudaya ki ludito maloyo lwak, ma wabedo kwedgi dok ma wacamo kwedgi cam kacel iwi mejana, medo ikom jo ma gubino bota ma gua ki ikin lurok ma gurumuwa. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Nino acel acel onongo aneko twon acel, ki romi mabeco abicel, ki dok kineko gweni mapol pira kitmeno dok pi nino aparapar myero kionya kongo bwino manyen. Ento ikom jami magi ducu ma atiyo pe abedo ki miti mo ni kimiya dul cam mo ma giciko ni laloc myero onong, pien onongo lwak dong gitye ki peko madwong atika ma obwoyo komgi woko. <verse eid="NEH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Alegi, ai Lubangana, po pi gin ducu ma atiyo pi lwak man, wek anong pwoc pire.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Piro lok ikom Nekemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Ka Canbalat, Tobia, Gecem, kacel ki jo ducu ma gin lukworwa guwinyo ni atyeko gero cel woko, dok ni kamo ma omuk ma twolone dong peke, kadi bed ikare meno onongo pud peya aketo rii me dogola me loro dog gang ducu, <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />ci Canbalat ki Gecem gucwalo lok bota, kun giwaco ni, “Bin wek wabed kacel i gang mo ma i bar me Ono.” Ento gin onongo gimito tima marac. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />An acwalo kwena botgi kun awaco botgi gin ni, “An atye katiyo tic mo ma pire dit mada, pe atwero bino kunu karwate kwedwu. Pe atwero weko tic man cung nono pi bino me nenowu keken.”<verse eid="NEH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Gin gubedo kacwala kwena teretere marom kitmeno tyen angwen kulu, dok an bene adwoko botgi lagam lakite acelu. <verse eid="NEH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Ka dok Canbalat ocwalo latice bota ki waraga i cinge ma pe kimwono doge pi lok lakite acelu pi tyen me abice. <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />Lok man kwane kitman ni,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="NEH 6:6">“Gecem otita ni lok tye kawot ikin lwak ma gicok kwedwa ni meno, in kacel ki lwak pa Lujudaya wumito jemo; meno aye gin ma omiyo wutye kagero cel odoconi. Lok man tito bene ni in ikete keni me bedo rwotgi. <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />Dok bene en otitiwa ni in dong ityeko keto lunebi me tucu lok atyer i Jerucalem ikomi ni, ‘In dong itye rwot i Juda.’ Loki to dong kibitito wa bot rwot Aritakcec. Pieno ber in kong ibin warib tame wayub loke kacel kwedi.”<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />An dok adwoko lok bote, kun awace ni, “Pe tye gin mo macalo meno ma otime, lok meno wun wungwaro ki wiwu.”<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Onongo guteme me buruwa wek wagik tic, kun gitamo ni, “Komwa bidoko nyap i tic, ci gimiyo tic dong pe bitime.” Ento kombedi alegi, Ai Lubanga, dong imiya abed matek.<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Ka acito wa i ot pa Cemaya wod pa Delaya, ma wod pa Meketabel, ma onongo pe twero weko ode, ci cut an acito kalime. En ka oneno an ci owaca ni, “Wek wacit kwedi kacel wa i Kabedo Maleng ma i Ot pa Lubanga, ci walor dogola me Ot pa Lubanga woko; pien koni gin bibino kaneko in woko. I dyewor mo keken gibibino gineki woko.”<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Ci an agamo doge ni, “An pe acal ki ngat ma ringo lawote ci kane wokoni. In itamo ni abitemo laro kwona ki kane i Ot pa Lubanga? Pe abitwero cito kwedi pi tiyone.” <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Ka abedo katamo lok man lacen, ci aniang atir ni Lubanga onongo pe oloko kwede, ento onongo Tobia ki Canbalat aye kara guwile ki lim wek otit lok macalo meno me bito an. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Guwile ki lim wek obur an abed ki lworo apot i bal, wek kicak balo nyinga kun giyeta kwedegu.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Ci alego ni, “Ai Lubangana, po ikom Tobia ki Canbalat, pi gin ma gubedo katimone ikoma, ci iket can ikomgi. Dok ipo ikom lanebi ma dako ma nyinge Noadia kacel ki lwak lunebi mukene ducu mayam gutemo buru an ki miya lworo.”<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agiki me tic</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Inge tic pi nino pyere abic wiye aryo tic me gero cel otum woko, inino dwe pyere aryo wiye abic me dwe me Elul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fk">Dwe me Elul </char> cake i dwe me aboro cito kwede i dwe me abongwen ma mewani.</note> <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Ikare ma lumerokwa ma gibedo i rok ma orumuwa guwinyo lok man, ci lworo omakogi ma komgi oto woko lirut; pien dano acel acel onongo ngeyo atir ni tic man otiine pi kony pa Lubanga. <verse eid="NEH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Ento ikare meno ducu ludito pa Lujudaya gubedo kacoyo waraga mogo ma pole kicwalo bot Tobia, ki Tobia bene coyo waraga cwalo botgi. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Lwak mapol ma i Juda onongo gitye tung bote ma gucike bote ki kwongo kwong, dok en onongo onyomo nyarpa Cekania ma wod pa Ara. Dok wode Yekokanan bene onongo yam onyomo nya pa Meculam wod pa Berekia. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Jo mogo bene guloko inyima lok kom tic maber ma Tobia yam otiyo, ka dok bene kidwoko bote lok ducu ma an awaco botgi, en Tobia yam omede ki cwalo waraga bota pi miyo lworo opot ikoma.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Ka tic me gero cel dong otum, ma aketo dogola lalor dogcel ducu, ci aketo lugwok dogola, ki luwer, ka dok ayero Lulevi aketogi i dog ticgi. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Aketo jo aryo me loyo taun madit me Jerucalem, omera Kanani, ki Anania, ma ladit wi mony maloyo taun me cel gogo. Anania obedo dano ma gene, dok ngat ma lworo Lubanga makato lwak mukenegu ducu. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Ci awaco botgi ni, “Pe wuwek kiyab dogcel me Jerucalem nio ka ceng dong odoko lyet, ka dok kilor dogcel woko kiceggi ki rii ma nongo pud peya lukurpiny guweko dog ticgi ma ceng cito kapoto. Ka dok bene atito botgi ni guyer lukurpiny ki ikin lwak ma gibedo i Jerucalem, ci guketogi i dog tic ma mite, dano acel acel myero obed i kabedone, kun kuru piny kama okeme ki ode kikome.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nying dano ma gudwogo cen ki i opii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZR 2:1-70">Eji 2:1-70</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Taun madit meno me Jerucalem onongo lac dok dit mada, ento jo ma gin bedo iye onongo pe gidwong, dok onongo pud peya kigero odi mapol iye.<verse eid="NEH 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Lubanga dok oketo tame i cwinya me guru lwak, wek arwate ki rwodi ki ludito ma giloyo wi lwak kacel, wek kico nyinggi i buk me tekwarogi. Ci anongo i buk me tekwaro nying jo ma gilubu jo mukwongo dwogo cen ki i opii, anongo kicoyo nyinggi kit man:<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Magi gin aye lwak ma con gubedo i lobo Juda ma ceng gudwogo cen ki i opii kama yam Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon oterogi iye kunu macalo lumabuc. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Lutela wigi aye Jerubabel, ki Yecwa, Nekemia, Ajaria, Raamia, Nakamani, Mordekai, Bilcan, Micperet, Bigvai, Nekum, ki Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Man aye wel co ma ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="NEH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Likwayo pa Paroc, alip aryo ki miya acel ki pyere abiro wiye aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Likwayo pa Cepatia, miya adek ki pyere abiro wiye aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Likwayo pa Ara, miya abicel ki pyere abic wiye aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Likwayo pa Pakat-moab, ma gin aye likwayo pa Yecwa ki Joab, alip aryo ki miya aboro ki apar wiye aboro. <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Likwayo pa Elam, alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyere abic wiye angwen, <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Likwayo pa Jatu, miya aboro ki pyere angwen wiye abic. <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Likwayo pa Jakai, miya abiro ki pyere abicel. <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Likwayo pa Binui, miya abicel ki pyere angwen wiye aboro. <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Likwayo pa Bebai, miya abicel ki pyere aryo wiye aboro. <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Likwayo pa Ajgad, alip aryo ki miya adek ki pyere aryo wiye aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Likwayo pa Adonikam, miya abicel ki pyere abicel wiye abiro. <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Likwayo pa Bigvai, alip aryo ki pyere abicel wiye abiro. <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Likwayo pa Adin, miya abicel ki pyere abic wiye abic. <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Likwayo pa Ater, ma en aye likwayo pa Kejekia, pyere abongwen wiye aboro. <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Likwayo pa Kacum, miya adek ki pyere aryo wiye aboro. <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Likwayo pa Bejai, miya adek ki pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Likwayo pa Karip miya acel ki apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Likwayo pa Gibeon, pyere abongwen wiye abic.<verse eid="NEH 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Jo ma yam kwarigi obedo i taun magi bene gudwogo cen: Beterekem kacel ki jo Netopa, miya acel ki pyere aboro wiye aboro. <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Jo Anatot, miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye aboro. <verse eid="NEH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Jo Beta-jimavet, pyere angwen wiye aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Jo Kiriat-arim, jo Kepira, ki jo Beerot, miya abiro ki pyere angwen wiye adek. <verse eid="NEH 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Jo Rama ki jo Geba, miya abicel ki pyere aryo wiye acel. <verse eid="NEH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Jo Mikmac, miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Jo Betel ki jo Ai, miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye adek. <verse eid="NEH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Jo Nebo mukenene, pyere abic wiye aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />Jo Elam mukenene, alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyere abic wiye angwen. <verse eid="NEH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Jo Karim, miya adek ki pyere aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Jo Jeriko, miya adek ki pyere angwen wiye abic. <verse eid="NEH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Jo Lod, jo Kadid, ki jo Ono, miya abiro ki pyere aryo wiye acel. <verse eid="NEH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Jo Cenaa, alip adek ki miya abongwen ki pyere adek.<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Man aye nying likwayo pa ajwaki ma gudwogo cen ki i opii: likwayo pa Jedaya, ma i dog ot pa Yecwa, miya abongwen ki pyere abiro wiye adek. <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Likwayo pa Imer, alip acel ki pyere abic wiye aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Likwayo pa Packur, alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyere angwen wiye abiro. <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Likwayo pa Karim, alip acel ki apar wiye abiro.<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Man aye wel Lulevi: likwayo pa Yecwa ki Kadmiel, ma ikin likwayo pa Kodeva, pyere abiro wiye angwen.<verse eid="NEH 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Luwer ma gin likwayo pa Acap, miya acel ki pyere angwen wiye aboro. <verse eid="NEH 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Likwayo pa lugwok dogola ma gin aye likwayo pa Calum, likwayo pa Ater, likwayo pa Talmon, likwayo pa Akub, likwayo pa Katita, likwayo pa Cobai, gin ducu onongo giromo miya acel ki pyere adek wiye aboro.<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Magi gin aye lutic i Ot pa Lubanga: likwayo pa Jika, likwayo pa Kacupa, likwayo pa Tabaot, <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />likwayo pa Keroc, likwayo pa Cia, likwayo pa Padon, <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />likwayo pa Lebana, likwayo pa Agaba, likwayo pa Camlai, <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />likwayo pa Kanan, likwayo pa Gidel, likwayo pa Gakar, <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />likwayo pa Re-aya, likwayo pa Rejin, likwayo pa Nekoda, <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />likwayo pa Gajam, likwayo pa Uja, likwayo pa Pacea, <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />likwayo pa Becai, likwayo pa Meunim, likwayo pa Nepucecim, <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />likwayo pa Bakbuk, likwayo pa Akupa, likwayo pa Arur, <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />likwayo pa Bajlit, likwayo pa Mekida, likwayo pa Arca, <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />likwayo pa Barkoc, likwayo pa Cicera, likwayo pa Tema, <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />likwayo pa Nejia, ki likwayo pa Katipa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Likwayo pa lutic pa Solomon gin ene: likwayo pa Cotai, likwayo pa Coperet, likwayo pa Perida, <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />likwayo pa Jaala, likwayo pa Darkon, likwayo pa Gidel, <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />likwayo pa Cepatia, likwayo pa Katil, likwayo pa Poceret-kajebaim, ki likwayo pa Amon.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Jo ma gitiyo i ot pa Lubanga ki likwayo pa lutic pa Solomon, onongo welgi romo miya adek ki pyere abongwen wiye aryo.<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Magi aye gin jo ma gubino ma gua ki i Tel-mela, Tel-karca, Kerub, Adon ki Imer, ento onongo pe gutwero nyutu dog odi pa kwarigi, kace onongo yam gin jo Icrael: <verse eid="NEH 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />likwayo pa Delaya, likwayo pa Tobia, ki likwayo pa Nekoda, gin ducu miya abicel ki pyere angwen wiye aryo.<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Dok jo magi onongo gitye ikin likwayo pa ajwaki: likwayo pa Kobaya, likwayo pa Kakoj, likwayo pa Barjilai mayam onyomo dakone ki ikin anyira pa Barjilai ma jo Gilead; yam kilwongo en ki nyinggi. <verse eid="NEH 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Gin gubedo kayenyo nyinggi ikin lwak nying ma kicoyogi i buk me tekwaro, ento pe gunongo iye nyinggi, omiyo kikwanyogi woko ki ikin ajwaki calo jo ma komgi ki keni. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:65: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Nia 28:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 33:8">Nwo 33:8</ref></char></note>Laloyo otito botgi ni gin pe gunywak camo cam maleng makato, nio wang ma ajwaka obinen ma bipenyo dog Rwot ki Urim ki Tumim.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Lwak ma gucoke ducu welgi romo alip pyere angwen wiye aryo ki miya adek ki pyere abicel, <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />ma pe kikwano iye lwak luticgi ki angecagi ma welgi romo alip abiro ki miya adek ki pyere adek wiye abiro. Onongo gitye bene ki luwer ma co ki ma mon miya aryo ki pyere angwen wiye abic. <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Aguraguragi yam tye miya abiro ki pyere adek wiye abicel, ki kanagi maditone miya aryo ki pyere angwen wiye abic, <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />kinagagi romo miya angwen ki pyere adek wiye abic, ki kanagi romo alip abicel ki miya abiro ki pyere aryo.<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Ikare meno jo mogo ma i kin ludito wi kaka ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarigi gumiyo kony me lim pi gero Ot pa Lubanga. Laloyo omiyo lim i ot kano lim maromo kilo aboro ki nucu me jabu, becen pyere abic, ki bongi aruka pa ajwaki maromo miya abic ki pyere adek. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Jo mogo ma i kin ludito wi kaka ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarigi bene gumiyo lim i ot kano lim pi tic, lim maromo kilo miya acel ki pyere abic wiye adek me jabu ki mina me ryal alip aryo ki miya aryo. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Jo mukene mudonge gumiyo lim maromo darik me jabu alip pyere aryo, ki mina me ryal alip aryo, ki bongi aruka pa ajwaki maromo pyere abicel wiye abiro.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:73: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 9:2">1 Tek 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 11:3">Nek 11:3</ref></char>
    </note>Ajwaki, Lulevi, ki lugwok dogola, luwer, ki jo mogo mukene, ma lutic i Ot pa Lubanga ki jo Icrael ducu gubedo kabedo i taun madit me Jerucalem ki i taun mapatpat matye i Juda.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ejira okwano buk me Cik bot jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Ikare ma dwe me abiro oromo, onongo jo Icrael dong gitye i taun gi. Ci lwak gucoke ki cwiny acel idyekal ma inyim Dogcel me Pii; ci gutito bot Ejira ni okel buk me Cik pa Moses mayam Lubanga omiyo bot jo Icrael. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Ci Ejira okelo buk me Cik inyim kacoke, matye iye co ki mon ki jo ducu mayam giromo winyone ki niang iye maber. Man obedo inino dwe mukwongo me dwe me abiro. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Ejira ocako kwanone inyimgi, kun ocung okemo dyekal ma inyim Dogcel me Pii. En ocako kwanone i odiko nio kwede wa dyeceng, ma kwano inyim co ki mon ducu ki jo ma gitwero niang loke man maber, kun dano ducu bene guciko itgi kawinyo lok ma i buk me Cik.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Ejira ocung iwi abam bao ma kitiyo pi kwano lok meno. Jo magi yam gucung kangete tung lacuc: Matitia, Cema, Anaya, Uria, Ilkia, ki Maceya; ka dok jo magi gucung kangete tung lacam: Pedaya, Micael, Malkija, Kacum, Kacbadana, Jekaria, ki Meculam. <verse eid="NEH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Ikare ma Ejira ocung malo kamaleng i kabedo me kwano buk, lwak ducu guciko wanggi ikome. Teke en oyabo buk me cako kwanone ci dano ducu gua malo gucung acunga. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Ejira okwongo ki pako Rwot, Lubanga madit; ci lwak ducu gugamo ni, “Amen, Amen,” kun gitingo cinggi malo; ka dok guryebe piny, ci guworo Rwot ma gukulu wigi piny i ngom.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Ka dok lwak gucung i kabedogi, ci Lulevi magi: Yecwa, Bani, Cerebia, Jamin, Akub, Cebetai, Kodia, Maceya, Kelita, Ajaria, Jojabad, Kanan, ki Pelaya, gukonyo lwak me niang te Cik maber, kun onongo lwak gucung i kabedogi mot. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Gukwano lok me cik nia ki i buk me cik, en aye buk me Cik pa Lubanga, dok gugonyo teloke ma atir bot lwak, wek guniang iye maber lok ma kikwano.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Ka lwak dong guwinyo lok ma kikwano ki i buk me Cik, ci gin gucako koko cut. Ci Nekemia ma onongo en laloc, ki Ejira ma onongo en ajwaka dok bene lapwony Cik pa Lubanga, kacel ki Lulevi ma gupwonyo lwak guwaco bot lwak ni, “Man aye nino maleng bot Rwot Lubangawa; pe wukum dok bene pe wukoki.” <verse eid="NEH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Dok owaco botgi ni, “Dong wuwot, wucit wucam gin ma moo ki wumat kongo bwino malingo, wucwal cam mogo bot dano mo ma pe ki cam; pien tin aye nino maleng bot Rwotwa; pien yomcwiny pa Rwot en aye tek mewu.” <verse eid="NEH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Lulevi gujuku dano guling mot, kun giwaco ni “Wubed mot laling, pien man aye nino maleng; pe wubed iye ki cwercwiny.” <verse eid="NEH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Ci lwak guket gucito i gangigi kacam ki kamat, dok gucwalo cam mogo ma gitye kwede bot luwotgi mukene, pi bedo ki yomcwiny madwong, pien guwinyo lok ma kikwano dok bene kitito botgi ci guniang iye maber.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Karama me nino madito me Bolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Ikom nino me aryone ludito ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarigi ma gitye ikin lwak ducu, kacel ki ajwaki ki Lulevi, gucito bot Ejira ma lapwony Cik pa Lubanga pi ngiyo lok ducu matye i buk me Cik.<verse eid="NEH 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:14:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:33-36">Lev 23:33-36</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:39-43">23:39-43</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13-15">Nwo 16:13-15</ref></char>
    </note> Ci gunongo kama kicoyo i buk me Cik ni, Rwot yam ociko Moses ni jo Icrael omyero gubed i bolo pi kwero nino madito me dwe me abirone, <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />dok omyero guywek loke wek gutit i gangigi ducu ki i Jerucalem, kun giwaco ni, “Wucit iwi godi kakelo jang jeituni, ki jeituni ma i tim, ki yadi ma ngwecgi kur, yat otit ki yadi ma potgi oluk wek wayub bolo mapol, kit ma kicoyo i buk me Cik.” <verse eid="NEH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Lwak ducu gucito kakelo jami ma kitito pireni ci gutiyo bolo mapol me bedogi, kun dano acel acel timo mere, iwi odigi, idyekalgi, ki idyekal me Ot pa Lubanga, ki idyekal ma i Dogcel me Pii, ki idyekal ma i dogcel ma kilwongo ni pa Epraim. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Ki jo ducu ma con gudwogo ki i opii i rok mukene gutiyo bologi ci gubedo iye; Cake ikare pa Yocwa wod pa Nun nio kwede wa inino meno jo Icrael pe gutiyo kitmeno. Ci gubedo ki yomcwiny madit tutwal. <verse eid="NEH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Dok nino ki nino kikwano lok matye i buk me Cik pa Lubanga nicake ikom nino mukwongo nio kwede wa inino me agikine. Gukwero nino me coke maleng pi nino abiro; ikom nino me aborone, gubedo ki coke maleng me lorone, ma olubu cik kikome.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gutucu balgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />I dwe man me abiro ninone pyere aryo wiye angwen jo Icrael ducu gucoke, kun girii kec ma guruku bongo cola, ma gunyweno wigi ki lobo me nyutu cwercwinygi pi balgi. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Jo Icrael gupoke woko ken gi ki ikom lurok ducu, ka gucung katucu balgi kacel ki bal pa kwarigi mayam gutimo. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Gin gucung i kabedogi, kun kikwano botgi lok matye i buk me Cik pa Rwot Lubangagi pi cawa adek; ka ingeye gutucu balgi ci guworo Rwot Lubangagi pi cawa adek mukene.<verse eid="NEH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Lulevi magi gucung iwi abam: Yecwa, Bani, Kadmiel, Cebania, Buni. Cerebia, Bani ki Kenani; gin ducu gudange ki dwon ma longo bot Rwot Lubangagi.<verse eid="NEH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Lulevi magi: Yecwa, Kadmiel, Bani, Kacabneya, Cerebia, Kodia, Cebania ki Petakia guwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:5">“Wua malo wupak Rwot Lubangawu; wupake nakanaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:5">Wek dano acel acel opak nyingi me deyo makato ducuni, ai Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:5">kadi bed pwoc ki pak pa dano pe rom ki dit ma meri.”<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega me tucu bal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Ka dong gulego lega man ni, “Rwot, In keni aye i Rwot; in aye ma icweyo polo ma malo makato ducuni, ki lwak lakalatwe matye i pologu ducu, dok in aye ma icweyo lobo ki nam ki gigu ducu matye i igi; in aye imiyo kwo botgi ducu. Dok twero ducu ma i polo bene giryebe piny kaworo in. <verse eid="NEH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Aca 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:5">17:5</ref></char></note>In aye i Rwot Lubanga mayam iyero Abram ci ikwanyo en woko ki Ur ma en aye lobo pa Lukaldaya, ka imiyo bote nying manyen ni Abraim. <verse eid="NEH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Aca 15:18</ref></char></note>Dok con inongo ni en ngat ma gene, ka dong iketo gicikeni kwede pi miyo lobo pa jo Kanaan, lobo pa jo Kit, lobo pa jo Amor, lobo pa jo Periji, lobo pa jo Jebuc ki lobo pa jo Girgac, me bedo lobo ma likwaye gibibedo iye. In icobo lok ma iciko, pien in Lubanga ma opore.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:7">Nia 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:10-12">14:10-12</ref></char>
    </note>In yam ineno atwom ma kwariwa gubedo kwede i Ejipt, dok bene iwinyo kokogi ki i dog Nam Makwar. <verse eid="NEH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:8-12:32">Nia 7:8—12:32</ref></char></note>In itiyo bene lanyut ki tango me aura ikom Parao ki lutice ducu, ki ikom jo ducu ma i lobone, pien in onongo ingeyo kit ma gubedo kwede kaunu kwariwa; ma omiyo in ilimo iye yweka madit, macalo tye kwede nio wa onyo. <verse eid="NEH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-29">Nia 14:21-29</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:4-5">15:4-5</ref></char></note>In yam ipoko i nam pi lwaki, ka itelogi imiyo gukato ki iye iwi ngom ma otwo. Dok ibolo merok ma gulubu korgi woko i pii, imiyo gumwony ci gulwiny woko i kut matut, macalo gweng ma lwiny piny i pii mager. <verse eid="NEH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Nia 13:21-22</ref></char></note>In yam itelo nyimgi i dyeceng ki pol ma ocung macalo wir, ka dok itelo wigi idyewor ki mac ma ocung macalo wir me menyo botgi yoo kama myero guwot gucit iye. <verse eid="NEH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18-23:33">Nia 19:18—23:33</ref></char></note>In ilor ibino piny ikom got Cinai, ci iloko ki lwaki ki kunu ki i polo; ka imiyo botgi cik maber ki pwony ma omyero gin gulubi kacel ki gin ma iciko ducu. <verse eid="NEH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />In ipwonyogi ni gugwok Cabiti obed maleng, ka dok imiyogi cik kacel ki gin ma in iciko ni gugwoki, kun wok ki bot latici Moses. <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4-15">Nia 16:4-15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:21">Nwo 1:21</ref></char></note>Ikare ma kec onongo onekogi in ipitogi ki kwon ma oa ki i polo, ka dok imiyo gumato pii ma oa ki ikom pata got ikare ma orwo pii onekogi. Itito botgi bene ni gudony gucam lobo mayam ikwongo pire ni ibimiyo botgi.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:1-4">Wel 14:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:26-33">Nwo 1:26-33</ref></char>
    </note>Ento gin kacel ki kwariwa wigi obedo tek ci gubedo ki wake, omiyo gukwero lubu ciki. <verse eid="NEH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Nia 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Wel 14:18</ref></char></note>Gukwero lubune; dok wigi owil woko ikom tango mapol me aura ma ibedo katiyo ikin gi; wigi obedo tek ci guyero dano mo acel me bedo laditgi wek otel wigi odwokgi cen i opii i Ejipt. Ento in Lubanga ma weko bal pa danoni in iber dok in lakica, kiniga bene pe mako in oyot, mar meri dwong ma pe loke, yam pe ibwotogi ata. <verse eid="NEH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1-4">Nia 32:1-4</ref></char></note>Kadi bed yam gucweyo cal wod twon dyang ma kiliyo aliya, kun giwaco ni, ‘Man aye Lubangawa ma okwanyowa woko ki i Ejipt,’ gin ma gutiyoni gutiyo me yeto in Lubanga, <verse eid="NEH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:2-4">Nwo 8:2-4</ref></char></note>ento in pe ibwotogi ata i tim aroo pi kicani madwong; ci iweko pol ma ocung macalo wir me bedo katelo wigi i yoni, ma onongo pe orwenyo woko ki botgi i dyeceng, kadi mac ma ocung macalo wir me bedo kamenyo botgi yoo ma giwoto iye i dyewor kun bene pe orwenyo woko ki botgi. <verse eid="NEH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />In Rwot pi ber meri imiyo botgi pwony wek gutii gin ma imito, dok bene pe iweko pitogi ki manna, kun imiyogi bene gumato pii me kweyo orwo. <verse eid="NEH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />In yam igwokogi maber i tim pi mwaka pyere angwen, kun imiyo botgi gin ducu ma gin mito, dok bongigi bene yam pe gutii guyec woko ducu, ki tyen gi bene yam pe okwot.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Wel 21:21-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>In imiyo gulwenyo ci guloyo lwak rok mapol ata, ipoko botgi lobo macok ki wang apoki lobogi, kun gumayo lobo pa Cikon rwot me Kecibon kacel ki lobo pa Og rwot me Bacan. <verse eid="NEH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Aca 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Yoc 3:14-17</ref></char></note>In imiyo likwayogi gunya mapol gudoko macalo lwak lakalatwe ma i polo, in yam imiyogi lobo ma myero gubed iye, en lobo mayam ikwongo pire ni ibimiyo bot kwarigi wek gucam obed meggi. <verse eid="NEH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:23">Yoc 11:23</ref></char></note>Likwayogi gudonyo ci gumayo lobo pa jo Kanaan woko; dok in iloyo wegi lobo ma gibedo kunu, ci imiyogi icinggi gin kacel ki lukergi ki lwakgi ducu wek gutii kwedgi kit gin ma gimito. <verse eid="NEH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:10-11">Nwo 6:10-11</ref></char></note> Lwaki yam gumako taun madito ma gitye ki cel gogo kacel ki lobo ma ceko cam, ka gukwanyo odi ki lonyo ducu matye iye, ki bur pii ma kitucu odonyo i ngom piny, ki poti me yadi jeituni ki lwak yadi ducu ma nyako nyiggi, kacel ki poti olok ma ginyako nyiggi madwong; mayam gucamo guyeng kwede ka gucako cwe ma cwinygi obedo yom tutwal pi jami mapol mabeco ma imiyogini.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:11-16">Lung 2:11-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ento lwaki gujemo dok gukwero lubu ciki; gubolo ciki odok tung ingegi, kun gineko lunebini, ma gujukugi ni guloke gudwog boti, ci pe guwinyo, gubedo kayeti kare ducu. <verse eid="NEH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Pi meno omiyo iweko lukworgi oloyogi i lweny, dok gudiyogi matek; gukok boti ikare ma gitye i can ni ikonygi bene, ci in iwinyo kokogi ki i polo. Dong pi kicani madwong omiyo icwalo botgi jo ma myero otel wigi, gin jo mayam olarogi ki i cing lumerokgini. <verse eid="NEH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />Ento ikare ma kuc dok odwogo botgi, gin gucako timo bal dok aye inyimi, oweko in dok imiyogi i cing lumerokgi, guloyogi. Kadi bed kumeno ikare ma gungut guloke gudwogo gukok boti, ci iwinyo kokogi ki i polo pi tyen mapol ci ilarogi pi kicani madwong. <verse eid="NEH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref></char></note>In itito botgi ni guloke gudwog cen boti dok gulub ciki. Ento gin gubedo ki wake ci gukwero lubu ciki ducu, kadi bed nen atir ni mako ciki aye miyo dano bedo ki kwo, ento gin gutimo bal ikom gin ma in iciko. Gubedo ki tekwic gukwero lubu ciki woko. <verse eid="NEH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:13-18">2 Luk 17:13-18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:15-16">2 Tek 36:15-16</ref></char></note>Ibedo kajukugi pi mwaka mapol, kun ijukugi ki cwiny meri ma con otiyo i i lunebini; ento gin pe guwinyo. Omiyo iwekogi gubedo ite loc pa lwak me lobo me rok mukene. <verse eid="NEH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Ento pi kicani madwong omiyo pe ityekogi woko, dok bene pe ibwotogi ata; pien onongo in Lubanga ma i won kica madwong, ma kica maki tutwal.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:19">2 Luk 15:19</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 15:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:3-6">17:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 4:2">Eji 4:2</ref>,<ref loc="EZR 4:10">10</ref></char>
    </note>Kombedi, ai Lubangawa madit, ma won twero, dok in Lubanga ma kilworo, pien igwoko gicikeni ki mar meri ma pe loke, kadi wa ikare ma wabedo ki can ma pek tutwali in pe iweko obedo gin ma tidi mo ki tung boti, can meno opoto ikomwa, ki ikom lukerwa, ki ikom rwodiwa, ki ikom ajwakiwa, ki ikom lunebiwa, ki ikom kwariwa, ki ikom lwaki ducu, nia wa ikare pa luker me Aciria nio kwede wa onyo. <verse eid="NEH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Ento in itimo gin matye atir pi pwodowa kitmeno; in ibedo katic kwedwa ki ada, ento wan aye ma watyeko timo bal. <verse eid="NEH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Lukerwa, rwodiwa, kacel ki ajwakiwa, ki kwariwa ducu yam pe gugwoko ciki, dok pe gulubu gin ma iciko kadi wa juk ducu ma onongo ijukugi kwede. <verse eid="NEH 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Luker guloyo lwaki pi gum madit ma imiyo botgi, ikare ma gubedo kama lac i ngom maber ma ceko cam ma imiyo botgi, ento gin pe guloke, pe guweko timgi marac wek gutii gin ma imito. <verse eid="NEH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />Nen, kombedi wan dong wadoko opii i lobo mayam imiyowa ni wacam gin ma ocek i potone ki yomcwiny, kacel ki jami ducu mabeco ma nonge iye. <verse eid="NEH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Lonyo me lobo ducu cito icing luker ma in iketogi me loyowa pi balwa; gin gitye ki tek me loyo komwa ki limwa makwo ducu kit ma gimito, omiyo wan kombedi watye ki atwom madwong.”<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwak guketo cinggi i cike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />Pi gin ducu ma dong otyeko time, wan Lujudaya kombedi waketo cingwa icike ma wacoyo acoya i buk, dok rwodiwa, Lulevi ki ajwakiwa ducu guketo cinggi icike man me mokone matwal.<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Ngat ma okwongo keto cinge obedo Nekemia wod pa Kakalia, ma en laloc me lobo, ka ingeye Jedekia bene oketo cinge. <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Jo ma guketo cinggi bene obedo ajwaki magi: Ceraya, Ajaria, Jeremia, <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Packur, Amaria, Malkija, <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Katuc, Cebania, Maluk, <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Karim, Meremot, Obadia, <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Daniel, Gineton, Baruk, <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Meculam, Abija, Mijamin, <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Maajia, Bilgai, ki Cemaya.<verse eid="NEH 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Lulevi ma guketo cinggi obedo: Yecwa wod pa Ajania, Binui ma ikin likwayo pa Kenadad, Kadmiel; <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />ki utmegigi, Cebania, Kodia, Kelita, Pelaya, Kanan, <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Mika, Rekob, Kacabia, <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Jakur, Cerebia, Cebania, <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Kodia, Bani, Beninu.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Jo magi aye gubedo ludito maloyo lwak: Paroc, Pakat-moab, Elam, Jatu, Bani, <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buni, Ajgad, Bebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adoniya, Bigvai, Adin, <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Ater, Kejekia, Ajur, <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Kodia, Kacum, Bejai, <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Karip, Anatot, Nebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Magpiac, Meculam, Kejir, <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Mecejabel, Jadok, Jadua, <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Pelatia, Kanan, Anaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Kocea, Anania, Kacub, <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Kalokeci, Pilka, Cobek, <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Rekum, Kacabna, Maaceya, <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Akia, Kanan, Anan, <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Maluk, Karim, Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cike ma kimoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Wan jo Icrael, ajwaki, Lulevi, lugwok dogola me Ot pa Lubanga, luwer, ki lutic i Ot pa Lubanga ki jo mukene ducu ma onongo wapoke woko kenwa ki ikom jo ma gubedo i lobo meno, wek walubu Cik pa Lubanga, wan kacel ki monwa ki lutinowa awobe ki anyira ducu ma dong gin dito ma giromo niang lok, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />kombedi waribe ki utmegiwa, ki luditowa kun wakwongo kwong ma walame iye kekenwa ni wek can opot ikomwa kace pe wabilubu cik man, kun nongo pe walubu Cik pa Lubanga mayam Moses latic pa Lubanga omiyo botwa. Wakwongo ni wabibedo kun watiyo gin ducu ma Rwot ma en Rwotwa yam ociko, ki dok ni wabigwoko cike ducu ki gin ma en mito ni watii.<verse eid="NEH 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:16">Nia 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:3">Nwo 7:3</ref></char>
    </note>Wan pe wabimiyo lurok ma gibedo i lobowa me nyomo anyirawa, ki wan bene pe wabinyomo anyiragi bot awobewa.<verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:10-11">Nia 23:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Lev 25:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:1-2">Nwo 15:1-2</ref></char>
    </note> Kace lurok ma gitye i lobo man gukelo jamigi mo nyo kal, nyo kit nyig cam mo me catone botwa inino me Cabit, nyo inino mo maleng, ci wan pe wabiwilo jamigi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:31">Dok pe wabipuru pur i mwaka me abirone, ikare meno bene wabingolo banya ducu ma myero kicul.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Nia 30:11-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wan waye me miyo dul acel me adek me cekel mwaka ki mwaka pi konyo tic i Ot pa Lubangawa. <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Wabimiyo jami magi pi woro Lubanga; mugati me aketa inyim Rwot, gityer me moko kwon pi nino ducu, ki gityer me gitum awanga me nino ducu, gityer maleng pi nino me Cabit ducu, gityer me nino madito me por dwe, nino madito ma kiciko ducu, jami maleng ducu, ki gitum me bal pi kwanyo bal pa jo Icrael, ki jami ma mite pi tic ducu ma kitiyo i Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />Wan lwak, kacel ki ajwaki, ki Lulevi, wabibolo kwir mwaka ki mwaka me moko kaka mene ma omyero gukel yen i Ot pa Lubanga me wango gitum awanga ma kityero bot Rwot Lubangawa, kit macalo cik mito, kun kilubu dog odi pa kwarigi, ikare ma kiciko.<verse eid="NEH 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:19">Nia 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:26">34:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:2">Nwo 26:2</ref></char>
    </note>Wan waye me tero kal manyen ma wakayo, kacel ki nyig yadi ducu mukwongo cek, me bedo gityer i Ot pa Lubanga mwaka ki mwaka.<verse eid="NEH 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:2">Nia 13:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dok bene ngat acel acel ikinwa bitero latin laco ma en latin me kayone, miyo bot ajwaki ma gin lutic i Ot pa Lubanga, me dyerone bot Lubanga, ki dok bene wabimiyo lutino dyangiwa me kayo ma dyangiwa gunywalo ki lutino kayo romi nyo dyegi ma romiwa nyo dyegiwa ma gunywalo, kit macalo Cik mito.<verse eid="NEH 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:21">Wel 18:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wabitero moko kwon me kal manyen mukwongo cek wamiyo bot ajwaki, kacel ki jami me kony mewa ma wamiyo, ki gityer mukene ducu macalo me kongo bwino, moo nyig yat jeituni ki kit kwayi nyig yadi ducu mapatpat, mwaka ki mwaka, kun waketo i kicika odi matino me Ot pa Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:37">Wabimiyo dul acel me apar me kwayi cam mapatpat ma wapuru bot Lulevi ma gin lujog dul acel me apar ki bot lupur matye i gangiwa. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:26">Wel 18:26</ref></char></note> Ajwaki ma gin likwayo pa Aron gubed kacel ki Lulevi ikare ma nongo gigamo dul acel me apar. Lulevi omyero gutyer dul acel me apar me jami ma kijogo i Ot pa Lubanga, i kicika me odi matino, ki i odi me kano jami. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Jo Icrael kacel ki Lulevi myero gumii kal, kongo bwino, ki moo me nyig jeituni gukel i odi me kano jami, kama gigwoko iye jami ma kitiyo kwedgi i kabedo maleng, kama ajwaki gitye iye i dog tic, lugwok dogola, ki dul pa luwer. Wan pe wabibwoto Ot pa Lubangawa ata.<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Jo ma gubedo i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Lutela wi lwak gubedo i Jerucalem, kadong lwak mukenegu gubolo kwir me yero dog ot acel ikom apar me cito kabedo i taun madit maleng me Jerucalem, kadong jo mukene mudongeni gubedo i taun madito ki matino mukeneni. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Lwak gupwoyo jo ma gumine pirgi ken gi me bedo i Jerucalem.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 7:73">Nek 7:73</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Magi aye ludito me lobo Juda ma gubedo i Jerucalem. Ento ki i taun gi mukene ducu ma i Juda dano acel acel con obedo gire i lobone ma i taun maditogi, ci jo Icrael, ajwaki, Lulevi, lutic i Ot pa Lubanga, ki likwayo pa lutic pa Solomon, ngat acel acel okwo ki jamine kikome.<verse eid="NEH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Likwayo pa Juda ki likwayo pa Benjamin bene gubedo i Jerucalem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:4">Magi aye likwayo pa Juda ma gubedo i Jerucalem: Ataya ma wod pa Ujia, ma wod pa Jekaria, ma wod pa Amaria, ma wod pa Cepatia, ma wod pa Makalalel, ma ikin likwayo pa Perej.<verse eid="NEH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Maaceya wod pa Baruk, ma wod pa Kolkoje, ma wod pa Kajaya, ma wod pa Adaya, ma wod pa Joyarib, ma wod pa Jekaria, ma ikin likwayo pa Cela.<verse eid="NEH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Likwayo pa Perej ducu ma gubedo i Jerucalem onongo giromo miya angwen ki pyere abicel wiye aboro ma gin twoni oteka.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Magi aye likwayo pa Benjamin: Calu wod pa Meculam, ma wod pa Joed, wod pa Pedaya, ma wod pa Kolaya, ma wod pa Maaceya, ma wod pa Itiel, ma wod pa Jecaya.<verse eid="NEH 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />Jo ma gulubu en obedo Gabai, Calai, ki jo miya abongwen ki pyere aryo wiye aboro. <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Joel wod pa Jikri obedo laditgi: ki Juda wod pa Kacenua obedo ladit me aryo maloyo taun.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Magi aye likwayo pa ajwaki: mukwongo aye Jedaya wod pa Joyarib, ki Jakin. <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Me aryone aye Ceraya wod pa Ilkia ma wod pa Meculam ma wod pa Jadok, ma wod pa Merayot, ma wod pa Akitub, ma obedo ajwaka madit, <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />ki utmegigi ma gutiyo tic ikom ot, gin ducu miya aboro ki pyere aryo wiye aryo. Me adeke aye Adaya wod pa Jerokam, ma wod pa Pelalia, ma wod pa Amji, ma wod pa Jekaria, ma wod pa Packur, ma wod pa Malkija, <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />ki utmegine, ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarigi, gin ducu giromo miya aryo ki pyere angwen wiye aryo. Me angwene aye Amacai, ma wod pa Ajarel, ma wod pa Imer, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />ki utmegigi, ma gin twoni oteka ma ngene, gin ducu giromo miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye aboro. Jabdiel wod pa Kagedolim aye obedo laditgi.<verse eid="NEH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Magi aye likwayo pa Lulevi: Cemaya wod pa Kacub, ma wod pa Ajrikam, ma wod pa Kacabia, ma wod pa Buni; <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />ki Cabetai, ki Jojabad, ma gin ludito ikin ludito pa Lulevi, ma gubedo kaloyo dano i dog tic ma tung woko ma gitiyo ikom Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="NEH 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Ka dok Matania wod pa Mika, ma wod pa Jabdi, ma wod pa Acap, ma obedo latela ma en aye ocako lega ikare meno me pwoc, ki Bakbukia, ma en dano me aryone ikin utmegine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:17">Kadok Abda wod pa Camua, ma wod pa Galal, ma wod pa Jedutun. <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Lulevi ducu ma gubedo i taun madit maleng me Jerucalem gin ducu miya aryo ki pyere aboro wiye angwen.<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Lugwok dogola me Ot pa Lubanga obedo Akub, Talmon ki utmegigi mayam gigwoko dogola; onongo gin ducu miya acel ki pyere abiro wiye aryo.<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Jo Icrael mukene ma gudong kacel ki Lulevi ki ajwaki gubedo i dul lobo mayam kimiyo me bedo meggi matwal ki i taun mukene matye i Juda. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Ento lutic i Ot pa Lubanga gubedo i kabedo matye i Jerucalem ma kilwongo ni Opel; kun ludito ma loyogi i dog tic gin aye Jika ki Gicpa.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Ladit ma obedo lanen ma onongo loyo Lulevi i dog tic i Jerucalem obedo Uji wod pa Bani, ma wod pa Kacabia, ma wod pa Matania, ma wod pa Mika, ma ikin likwayo pa Acap, ma gin yam luwer pi tic ma i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Onongo rwot oketo cik ma tiko gin luwer kun tito botgi kit macalo kaka mapatpat myero guwer kwede wer i Ot pa Lubanga, kun gileyo aleya nino ki nino.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petakia wod pa Mecejabel, ma en ngat acel ikin likwayo pa Jera ma i kaka pa Juda, yam obedo lamii tam pa rwot ikom lok ducu ma mako lwak.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwak ma gibedo i taun madito ki ma i taun mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Jo mapol ma ikom lwak gubedo i taun gi matino macok ki potigi. Jo pa Juda gubedo i gang ma kilwongo ni Kiriat-arba ki i gangi matino ma ingete, ki i Dibon ki i gangi matino ma ingete, ki i Jekabjeel ki i gangi ma ingete ki taun madito ma ingete. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Gin bene gubedo i taun madito magi: Yecwa, Molada ki Betpelet, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />Kajar-cual ma i Beer-ceba ki i gangi matino ma i ngete. <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />Jiklag Mekona ki taun madito ki matino ma i ngete, <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />En-rimmon, Jora, Jarmut, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />Janoa, Adulam ki gangi matino ma ingetgi ducu, Lakic ki poto ma ingete, ki Ajeka ki gangi matino ma ingete. Gin gugony gubedo nia Beer-ceba nio kwede wa i nota pa Kinom. <verse eid="NEH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Jo Benjamin gubedo i Geba, Mikmac, Aija, Betel ki gangi matino ma i ngete, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />Anatot, Nob, Anania, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />Kajor Rama, Gitaim, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />Kadid, Jeboim, Nebalat, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Lod, ki Ono, i Nota pa Lutic Diro. <verse eid="NEH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Dok dul jo pa Lulevi mukene ma i Juda kiribogi woko ikom jo Benjamin.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Nying Ajwaki pa Lubanga ki Lulevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Magi aye ajwaki pa Lubanga ki Lulevi mayam gua ki i lobo opii ma gudwogo kacel ki Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel ki Yecwa: Ceraya, Jeremia; Ejira, <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amaria, Maluk, Katuc, <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Cekania, Rekum, Meremot, <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Iddo, Ginetoi, Abija, <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Mijamin, Maadia, Bilga, <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Cemaya, Joyarib, Jedaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Calu, Amok, Ilkia, Jedaya. Jo magi aye gubedo ludito pa ajwaki ki pa utmegigi ikare pa Yocwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Jo magi aye Lulevi: Yecwa, Binui, Kadmiel, Cerebia, Juda, ki Matania, ma en ki utmegine obedo ngat acel maloyo lok ikom wer me lega me pwoc ma kiwero bot Lubanga.<verse eid="NEH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Bakbukia, ki Uno ma utmegigi bene gicung tungcel ma gikeme kwedgi ikare me lega.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Yocwa ma obedo ajwaka madit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yocwa onywalo Joyakim, Joyakim onywalo Eliacib, Eliacib onywalo Joyada, <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Joyada onywalo Yonacan; ki Yonacan onywalo Jadua.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ludito ma giloyo dogola pa ajwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Ikare ma Joyakim obedo ajwaka madit, ajwaki magi aye onongo gin ludito maloyo dogola pa kwarigi: i kaka pa Ceraya, Meraya, i kaka pa Jeremia, Anania; <verse eid="NEH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />i kaka pa Ejira, Meculam, i kaka pa Amaria, Yekokanan; <verse eid="NEH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />i kaka pa Maluki, Yonacan; i kaka pa Cebania, Yucepu; <verse eid="NEH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />i kaka pa Karim, Adna; i kaka pa Merayot, Kelkai; <verse eid="NEH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />i kaka pa Iddo, Jekaria; i kaka pa Gineton, Meculam; <verse eid="NEH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />i kaka pa Abija, Jikri; i kaka pa Miniamin ki, i kaka pa Moadia, Peletai; <verse eid="NEH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />i kaka pa Bilga, Camua; i kaka pa Cemaya, Yekonatan; <verse eid="NEH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />i kaka pa Joyarib, Matenai; i kaka pa Jedaya, Uji; <verse eid="NEH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />i kaka pa Calai, Kalai; i kaka pa Amok, Eber; <verse eid="NEH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />i kaka pa Ilkia, Kacabia; i kaka pa Jedaya, Netanel.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nying jo me dogola pa ajwaki ki pa Lulevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Kicoyo nying ludito ma giloyo jo me dogola pa kwaro pa Lulevi woko ducu kikore, ikare me kwo pa Eliacib, Joyada, Yokanan, ki Jadua. Dok bene kicoyo nying ajwaki ducu nio wa ikare me loc pa rwot Dario me Percia.<verse eid="NEH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Likwayo pa Levi ma giloyo dogola pa kwarigi kicoyo nyinggi woko i buk me Tekwaro nio wa ikare pa Yokanan wod pa Eliacib.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poko tic ma myero kitii i Ot pa Lubanga kikore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Lulevi onongo kiribogi woko gubedo i dul mapatpat ma lulocgi i dog tic obedo Kacabia, Cerebia, ki Yecwa wod pa Kadmiel. Dul me aryo gupako Lubanga ki wer lawangacel kun giloco wer aloca, ma gumiyo pwoc bot Lubanga, kun gulubu cik ma rwot Daudi ma en dano pa Lubanga yam ociko.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Jo magi aye gubedo lugwok dogola me Ot pa Lubanga, dok bene onongo gikuru ot kano jami matye cok ki dogola me Ot pa Lubanga: Matania, Bakbukia, Obadia, Meculam, Talmon, ki Akub.<verse eid="NEH 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Jo magi gubedo ikare pa Joyakim, wod pa Yecwa ma en wod pa Yekojadak, ki ikare pa Nekemia ma obedo laloc, ki ikare pa Ejira ma en obedo ajwaka dok bene obedo lapwony Cik pa Lubanga.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nekemia odyero cel me taun madit ma kiyubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Ikare me kwero cel me Jerucalem, kikelo Lulevi ducu ki i kabedo ducu mayam gibedo iye, wek dano acel acel okwer nino man ki yomcwiny, ki wer me miyo pwoc, kacel ki wer ma kigoyo iye atego agoyagu, ki nanga ki opukgu. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Jo me dogola pa luwer gua ki i kabedo ducu ma orumu Jerucalem, ki i taun ducu pa jo Netopa; <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />ki jo mukene gua ki i Bet-gilgal ki i lobo ma orumu Geba ki Ajimavet, kama onongo yam dong gugero iye pacogi ma orumu Jerucalem. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Ajwaki kacel ki Lulevi gulonye keken gi; ka dok gulonyo lwak ki dogcel ducu ki cel me taun meno bene.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Ci an akelo rwodi me Juda ci aketo gucung malo iwi cel me taun, ka acako ketogi i dul madito aryo guwoto gurumu gang, kun giwero wer me miyo pwoc bot Rwot Lubanga. Jo ma i buca acel guwoto ki iwi cel me taun madit nio kwede wa i Dogcel me wi Odur. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Kocaya owoto kun lubu ngegi, ka dok nucu pa rwodi me Juda gulube. <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />Ajwaki magi ma gubedo kakutu tum aye dok gulubu, Ajaria, Ejira, Meculam, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Juda, Benjamin, Cemaya, ki Jeremia. <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />Ka dok ajwaki gubino gulubugi ma gubedo kakutu tum obedo Jekaria wod pa Yonacan, ma wod pa Cemaya, ma wod pa Matania, ma wod pa Mikaya, ma wod pa Jakur, ma wod pa Acap, <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />kacel ki jo magi ma gin jo me kakane ma gulubu en: Cemaya, Ajarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Netanel, Juda ki Kanani; gubino ma gumako jami me wer pa Daudi ma en dano pa Lubanga. Ejira ma en lapwony Cik pa Lubanga owoto mere anyim obedo katelo wigi. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Ka guo i Dogcel me Wang It guwoto atir guito ikom rwom ma cito i gang kal pa Daudi, ci gukato ot me kal pa Daudi woko guwok ki malo, ka gudok cen ikom cel macok ki Dogcel me Pii matye tung kunyango me Jerucalem.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Jo ma i dul mukene ma gubedo kamiyo pwoc bot Lubanga guwoto gudok yo tung lacam, ka dong an, kacel ki nucu pa lwak wacako lubugi. Wawoto ki iwi cel mamalo inyim Lubele me Keno, wao kwede ikom Cel Malac, <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />ki kunu wawoto wakato ki iwi Dogcel pa Epraim wawok ki i Dog Gang Macon, ka wao kwede i Dogcel me Rec, ka wawok ki inget Lubele ma kilwongo Kananel ki inget Lubele ma kilwongo Miya, ka wacito wao kwede wa i Dogcel me Romo; ka dong wabino wagiko wotwa cok ki Dogcel pa Lukurpiny. <verse eid="NEH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Kitmeno lwak ducu ma gitye i dul aryoni ma gubedo kamiyo pwoc bot Lubanga guo i kabedo kama Ot pa Lubanga tye iye, an kacel ki nucu ludito pa lwak onongo watye kacel. <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />Ajwaki magi onongo gitye i dul ma mera: Eliakim, Maaceya, Miniamin, Mikaya, Elioenai, Jekaria ki Anania, ma gumako tum; <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />ki Maaceya, Cemaya, Eleajar, Uji, Yekokanan, Malkija, Elam ki Ejer. Luwer guwero wer ki dwon gi malongo adada ma Jejrakia aye obedo katelogi ki wer.<verse eid="NEH 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Inino meno kityero gitum mapol, dok lwak bene gubedo ki yomcwiny madwong, pien Lubanga omiyo cwinygi obedo yom tutwal. Mon kacel ki lutino bene cwinygi obedo yom matek ikare meno me kwero cel me taun. Ma omiyo wo me yomcwiny ma jo gubedo kadange kwede i Jerucalem owinye wa i kabedo matye kamabor.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jami ma kimiyo pi woro Lubanga i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Ikom nino meno kiyero jo ma giloyo kicika odi me kano jami, kama kigwoko iye jami ma kimiyo me kony pi Ot pa Lubanga, ngano manyen ki nyig yat mukwongo cek i mwaka acel acel, kacel ki dul acel me apar, kibiketo kit macalo cik mito pi konyo ajwaki ki Lulevi, kun lubu kit wel poti ma i taun matino. Jo Juda cwinygi obedo yom tutwal ikom ajwaki ki Lulevi ma gubedo katic. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:45:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1-8">1 Tek 25:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 26:12">26:12</ref></char></note>Gin gutiyo gin ma Lubangagi ocikogi, dok bene gutiyo tic me lonyo dano, kit macalo yam luwer ki lugwok dogola gutimo, kit macalo con Daudi ki wode Solomon guciko pire. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Ikare pa Daudi ki Acap ma onongo en ladit me wer, luwer onongo giwero wer me pak ki me miyo pwoc bot Lubanga. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Ikare pa Jerubabel ki ikare pa Nekemia jo Icrael ducu gubedo kamiyo jami i kit macalo mot me nino ducu pi konyo luwer me Ot pa Lubanga, ki pi lugwok Ot pa Lubanga. Ci lwak bene gumiyo gityer maleng bot Lulevi, ki Lulevi bene gumiyo dul ma mite bot ajwaki ma gin likwayo pa Aron.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Poke ki ikom Lurok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:3-5">Nwo 23:3-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare meno kikwano Cik pa Moses bot lwak wek guwiny; ci gunongo i dul mo kama kicoyo ni pe kiye dano mo ma en jo Ammon kadi ki jo Moab me donyo i coke pa lwak ma gin jo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Wel 22:1-6</ref></char></note>Lok man kicoyo pien onongo jo Ammon ki jo Moab yam gukwero miyo cam ki pii bot jo Icrael ikare ma gia woko ki i Ejipt. Gin guwilo Balaam me ceno jo Icrael, ento Lubangawa oloko cenowani odoko me gum botwa. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Ikare ma jo Icrael dong guwinyo kikwano cik, ci gucako poko jo ma gin likwayo pa lurok woko ducu ki ikom jo Icrael.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alokaloka ma Nekemia okelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Ikare ma lok man peya otime, onongo ajwaka Eliacib mayam kiketo en me loyo kicika ma i Ot pa Lubanga, omako larem gin ki Tobia. <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />En oyubu kicika acel malac pi Tobia, mayam onongo obedo me gwoko jami macalo gityer me moko kwon ki odok luban ma kityero, jami ma kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga, ki dul acel me apar me ngano, kongo bwino ki moo mayam kimiyo bot Lulevi ki luwer ki lugwok dogola pi lubu cik, kacel ki jami me mot pi konyo ajwaki. <verse eid="NEH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Ikare ma loke time onongo an apeke i Jerucalem, pien i mwaka me pyere adek wiye aryo me loc pa Aritakcec rwot me Babilon onongo acito katito lok man bot rwot. Ikare mo alego rwot ni owek adok cen, <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />ci en oye omiyo adok cen i Jerucalem, ci cut anongo ni Eliacib otimo bal me ye ni Tobia obed i kicika acel idyekal ma i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Kiniga omaka matek, ci abolo jami pa Tobia me ot woko ducu ki i kicika meno. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Dok amiyo cik cut me lonyo kicika ducu; ka dong acako dwoko iye jami ma kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga, kacel ki tyer me moko kwon ki odok luban.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 12:19">Nwo 12:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dok bene anongo ni Lulevi kacel ki luwer ma gubedo katic gua woko ki i Jerucalem gudok cen i potigi, pien lwak pe gumiyo dul ma kiciko me amiya bot Lulevi. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Ci an acako da ikom ludito ma giloyo lwak kun awaco ni, “Pingo wuweko gubwoto Ot pa Lubanga?” Acako coko Lulevi kacel ki luwer adwokogi cen i Ot pa Lubanga ci aketogi i dog ticgi i kabedogi. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:10">Mal 3:10</ref></char></note>Jo Juda ducu gukelo dul acel me apar me ngano, kongo bwino ki moo i kicika odi me kano jami. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Ci aketo jo magi me loyo tic ikom kicika odi me kano jami: Celemia ma en ajwaka, Jadok ma lapwony Cik ki Pedaya ma en Lalevi. Dok aketo Kanan wod pa Jakur, ma wod pa Matania, me bedo lakonygi, pien onongo dano ducu gingeyo ni gin jo ma lugen; ticgi obedo me poko jami bot utmegigi.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Po pira ikom lok man, ai Lubangana, pe ijwa tica mabeco ma dong atyeko tiyone me yubu Ot pa Rwot Lubangana ki pi tice mapol woko.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:8-10">Nia 20:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-14">Nwo 5:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21-22">Jer 17:21-22</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare meno abedo kaneno jo mapol ma i Juda gubedo kabiyo kongo bwino i bur kama kibiyo iye inino me Cabit, kun jo mukene guyweko nyig ngano, kongo bwino, nyig olok, nyig oduru ki kit kwayi yec ducu mapatpat gutweyo iwi kana gutero i Jerucalem, inino me Cabit. Ci an ajukugi bene ni pe gucat cam inino meno. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Jo mogo ma gua ki i lobo ma orumu lobo Turo onongo bene yam gibedo i Jerucalem, ci gukelo rec ki kwayi jami ducu me acata, ci gucato bot jo Juda ki i Jerucalem inino me Cabit. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Omiyo akeco matek ikom ludito me Juda kun awaco botgi ni, “Man kit gin marac ango ma wutye katiyoneni, ma wupyedo kwede ceng Cabit? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Lubangawa mono pe okelo can man ikomwa ki ikom taun man ni pien kwariwa bene yam gutiyo kitmeno? Wun dok wutye kamedo akemo pa Lubanga ni obin ikom jo Icrael pi pyedo ceng Cabit.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Ci amiyo cik ni i acaki ceng Cabit ducu, teke piny dong mito yutu, dogcel ducu myero kilor woko, ma pe dok myero kiyabgi nio wang ma nino me Cabit okato. Aketo jona mogo kakuru dog taun me neno ni yec mo pe kikelogi i taun i ceng Cabit. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Lucat wil ki lucat jami ducu ma kitgi patpat ma gukelo jamigi gubutu inge taun madit me Jerucalem, kicel nyo kiryo. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Ento ajukugi kun apenyogi ni, “Pingo wun wubutu woko inge taun inyim cel? Ka dok wumede katimo kitmeno ci abilweny kwedwu ki tek.” Nia ikare meno pe dok gudwogo cen i ceng Cabit. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Amiyo cik bot Lulevi ni myero gulonye keken gi ci gucit kakuru dogcel ducu, me neno ni kigwoko nino me Cabit obedo maleng.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Ai Lubangana, po pira, ki pi lok man bene, dok ilar kwona pi dit me mar meri ma pe loke.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Nia 34:11-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:1-5">Nwo 7:1-5</ref></char>
    </note>Ikarenu bene aneno co mapol ma gin Lujudaya gunyomo anyira Acidod, Ammon ki Moab, gudoko mon gi. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Omiyo nucu pa lutinogi gubedo kaloko leb pa jo Acidod, ki leb Moab. Ki jo mukene ma dong pe gitwero loko leb Ibru ma en aye leb pa jo Juda. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Akeco ikomgi omiyo acenogi woko kun apwodo jo mogo ki ikin gi, dok aputu yer wigi woko; ci amiyo gukwongo kwong inying Lubanga, ni pe dok gibimiyo anyiragi bot awobe pa Lurok ni gunyomgi, dok gin bene pe gibikwanyo anyira pa Lurok me anyoma pi awobegi kadi gin bene pe binyome kwedgi. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:24-25">2 Cam 12:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:1-8">Luk 11:1-8</ref></char></note>Ci awaco botgi ni, “Wun yam pe wuneno ni Solomon yam otimo bal pi lok pa mon ma gin anyira rok? Ikin rok mapol onongo pe tye rwot mo macalo Solomon pien Lubanga omaro Solomon makato omiyo Lubanga oketo en obedo rwot maloyo Icrael; ento kadi bed kumeno mon ma gin anyira rok mukene gumiyo en opoto i bal. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Wun mono bene wumito ni wan bene walub lanen me gin marac ma wun wutimo, wek pe walub Cik pa Lubangawa, pi nyomo anyira pa lurok me bedo monwa?”<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 4:1">Nek 4:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dok dano mo acel ma ikom likwayo pa Yekoyada, wod pa Eliacib ajwaka madit, onongo bene onyomo nya pa Canbalat ma jo Bet-koron, ci aryemo en woko ki bota ni pe obed i Jerucalem.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Ai Lubangana, in ipo pirgi, pien dong gubalo nyinggi woko me bedo ajwaki, ki dok bene gubalo gicike ma iketo ikin in ki ajwaki kacel ki Lulevi.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />An dong alonyo jo Icrael woko kitmeno ki ikom gin ducu ma obedo pa lurok, ka dok acako moko tic pa ajwaki ki Lulevi, kun dano acel acel ngeyo dog tice ma myero etii. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Ka dok ayubu kit ma myero kikel iye yen me gityer ikare ma mite kikome, kacel ki gityer me cam me wi mwaka ma okwongo cek.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Po pira ikom lok man, ai Lubangana, wek dong itima maber.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>